# A. Student Marks Validation

## Rule Name

```text id="7j5v4q"
Marks_Validation
```

## Formula

```text id="d2otku"
OR(Marks__c < 0, Marks__c > 100)
```

## Error Message

```text id="v7ubef"
Marks should be between 0 and 100
```

Save.

