# STEP 4 — Apex Email Functionality

Now create Apex class.

Go to:

```text id="of6j7s"
Setup → Apex Classes → New
```

Paste:

```java id="qov7rk"
public class SendEmailController {

    public static void sendEmail() {

        Messaging.SingleEmailMessage mail =
            new Messaging.SingleEmailMessage();

        mail.setToAddresses(
            new String[] {'yourgmail@gmail.com'}
        );

        mail.setSubject(
            'Salesforce Email Test'
        );

        mail.setPlainTextBody(
            'Hello, Email sent successfully from Salesforce Apex.'
        );

        Messaging.sendEmail(
            new Messaging.SingleEmailMessage[] {mail}
        );

        System.debug('Email Sent Successfully');
    }
}
```

Save.

