# MOST IMPORTANT VIVA QUESTIONS

---

## What is Lightning Application?

A modern Salesforce application created using Lightning framework.

---

## What is Validation Rule?

Used to validate data before saving.

---

## What is Apex?

Backend programming language of Salesforce.

---

## What is App Manager?

Used to create and manage Lightning apps.

---

## Why use Validation Rules?

To maintain data accuracy and integrity.

---

## What is Messaging.SingleEmailMessage?

Salesforce class used to send emails.

---

## What is TODAY()?

Returns current system date.

